{"title":"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 19","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_19\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 19</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_19\">Problem 19</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 19\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/e/04ec15cf658430b90d5191381a8207fff1b78141.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^4 + 4x^3 + 6px^2 + 4qx + r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"206\" height=\"18\" /> is exactly divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/6/606df8c629744bda0db553551c628b963eb45c61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^3 + 3x^2 + 9x + 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"139\" height=\"16\" />, the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/c/3dc214d155fae1531acfb5270c0864da6e378535.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(p + q)r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" /> is: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/b/56b3d70496f4dfde83945e1a97309e96bea89525.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ - 18 \\qquad  \\textbf{(B) }\\ 12 \\qquad  \\textbf{(C) }\\ 15 \\qquad  \\textbf{(D) }\\ 27 \\qquad  \\textbf{(E) }\\ 45 \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"441\" height=\"17\" />  \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/f/8bf3a16d4eb79789578c8c3171e6a4eae8e4c38d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=x^3+3x^2+9x+3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"201\" height=\"21\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/7/f27937182da60cfe53103a43abb5f49014f09aac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x)=x^4+4x^3+6px^2+4qx+r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"267\" height=\"21\" />. \n</p><p>Let 3 roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae8889150ef5f04b9b7fdf6abc17e11410198ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r_1, r_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"37\" height=\"11\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/e/5ae5f496b8ddda88b5cbbc06ccb02bee0580fd0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r_3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" />. As  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/3/b3372d823b8848eff9750c54c1a2e89c041fcda6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)|g(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"73\" height=\"18\" /> , 3 roots of 4 roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/9/659a6a2610357101d77dbae8eb9bf0b3100c08fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> will be same as roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" />. Let  the 4th root of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/9/659a6a2610357101d77dbae8eb9bf0b3100c08fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/c/a7ce82c4f62f7e439d80be7f44293f527af4619b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r_4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" />.  By <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Vieta%27s_Formulas\" title=\"Vieta&#39;s Formulas\">Vieta's Formulas</a>\n</p><p>In <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/c/2ec3f85515884a08d22fcbc713a6be630068b901.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r_1+r_2+r_3=-3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"141\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/6/bc692f097c8b1e81c5e7d4644108bc75328aa03e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r_1r_2+r_2r_3+r_1r_3=9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"174\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/8/2180623596eb30a357c8847aa778293453ead4c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r_1r_2r_3=-3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>In <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/9/659a6a2610357101d77dbae8eb9bf0b3100c08fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/d/93d7ab8294d1baa30e0ee0db519b0e537661eec5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r_1+r_2+r_3+r_4=-4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"179\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/a/61a03de9305edc62f222d4a0a2b75ece9c1edb68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=&gt;r_4=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"98\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/9/859747d350693bc2dee51af77211750f6d59b59c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r_1r_2+r_1r_3+r_1r_4+r_2r_3+r_2r_4+r_3r_4=6p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"343\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/2/d82c530095ce3307a11e53011871a3c46162f6ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=&gt;r_1r_2+r_1r_3+r_2r_3+r_4(r_1+r_2+r_3)=6p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"359\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/8/ec8c3eb6727c232d049d02e3f6562f977c42a429.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=&gt;9+(-1)(-3)=6p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"184\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/5/285f6b7dcb90365e5463e2bcd1da322a949a5a9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=&gt;p=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"78\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/4/de4a7c560c8bc91db369ee5af87df03c38d7cf2a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r_1r_2r_3+r_1r_3r_4+r_1r_2r_4+r_2r_3r_4=-4q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"313\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/2/0f20bec8e7b0f25658609248b87a3d01033f95d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=&gt;-3+r_4(r_1r_3+r_1r_2+r_2r_3)=-4q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"305\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/b/78b7a96faf77fba24a3721e4c0c7e9a74bb01af3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=&gt;-3+(-1)(9)=-4q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"197\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/c/a2cb7e525902f63beea59a355898e426f1e28c71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=&gt;q=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/0/c705296bd0e3c49c0df490f768f2db967927ef70.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r_1r_2r_3r_4=r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"97\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/2/f727cf0d67d2ee315cb40ed32cd7d50cd8c5d2f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=&gt;(-3)(-1)=r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"143\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/b/a2b36c139944b1de475007739755ffe4097afa70.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=&gt;r=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"77\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/e/dae224166948c6732e4ea9cc402105592d0e9eb5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(p+q)r=\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) }15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"154\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>By ~Ahmed_Ashhab\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that to obtain the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/0/2f0078b54474db2dbf6219e8386b9b62c4405c94.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^4$\" width=\"17\" height=\"15\" /> term one must multiply <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/d/4ad5726c4ea74f664298c5e58beb7bf7003a94e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^4+4x^3+6px^2+4qx+r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"209\" height=\"20\" /> by some linear function of the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/b/79b2b7ab0341df3dd3ea02ee6680ae31a947af07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-a$\" width=\"42\" height=\"8\" />. Looking at the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/5/48524d3889ec8433cb03669176e738011df245b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^3$\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" /> term, it is clear that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> must equal <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Therefore by multiplying <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/d/4ad5726c4ea74f664298c5e58beb7bf7003a94e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^4+4x^3+6px^2+4qx+r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"209\" height=\"20\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/c/cccb103143393c0119f5ab61d6d53a852ce70fcf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" />, the product will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/3/073ce921463f2ad580d08fc3b5b7f50f225be763.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^4+4x^3+12x^2+12x+3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"209\" height=\"18\" />. Therefore  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/b/25b803838ba4ded99f094071740c256527784b2e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/9/a99bb04a5525117c5f4322d6886c384021a05ecc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/f/31faa8c684ba5811ac60ea1bd0c855d8ef4d8b16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r=3$\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" />. Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/c/5ac3e7ab5eb3da7327552c8efc4f2c434f53dcf9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2+3)3=\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) }15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"154\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME\" title=\"1965 AHSME\">1965 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1965 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1965\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME